WEBVTT

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:15.265
Accused!

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:25.316
In order for Arshes Nei
to break the spell,

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.486
she must rip out
Dark Schneider's heart from his body

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.573
while it's still warm
and dripping red with his blood.

00:00:31.656 --> 00:00:33.825
Nei has the upper hand here.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:38.705
They're two sides of the same coin,
and when identical forces meet,

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:42.542
the resulting collision can generate
a reaction of seismic levels.

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:46.838
That means the impact of the force
will repel them both back.

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:49.382
And the weaker won't survive.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.805
Oh, I almost forgot… I'll be right back.

00:00:57.348 --> 00:01:00.351
<i>No way. He could die out there.</i>

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:01.895
<i>Lucien…</i>

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:05.065
Are you seriously going
to fight anyway?

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:07.108
Even though you know you could die?

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:09.569
No way a handsome guy could lose.

00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:11.988
So you can trust me when I say
there's no way I'll die.

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:15.742
Yes, but I'm still scared.

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:19.496
It's just that I can't see you hurt.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.498
I don't think I can do it anymore.

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:26.586
I can't just stand by and watch you break
your body for Meta-llicana's sake.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:33.593
My worst fears are manifesting.
Empress Nei is already near the castle!

00:01:33.676 --> 00:01:36.179
She must have used the storm as cover.

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:39.641
Oh, great Raijinken reborn,

00:01:39.724 --> 00:01:42.769
lend your power
so that the spell is carried out!

00:01:42.852 --> 00:01:44.729
Dei-vu Mu-staiine!

00:01:45.313 --> 00:01:49.025
<i>I'm not saying this</i>
<i>as a princess, but as a woman.</i>

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.944
<i>I can't stand by and watch</i>

00:01:51.027 --> 00:01:53.780
<i>as the man I love</i>
<i>goes off to meet his death.</i>

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:55.240
<i>And do nothing.</i>

00:01:55.323 --> 00:01:57.534
Oh, spirits of the earth and air,

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:01.746
I summon you with a task to complete,
to fulfill our ancient pact!

00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:04.207
Megadeath!

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:12.507
Die!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:14.342
Die and be gone!

00:02:17.887 --> 00:02:18.888
Master Gara!

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.474
Master Gara!

00:02:21.558 --> 00:02:23.518
No. There's no way.

00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:25.562
She used the spell Megadeath!

00:02:26.729 --> 00:02:29.524
I was completely sure
no one except Dark Schneider

00:02:29.607 --> 00:02:31.943
was even capable of using that spell.

00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:34.154
Could… could it be?

00:02:40.034 --> 00:02:42.871
That was close! Way, way too close!

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:47.917
That had to be Megadeath.

00:02:48.418 --> 00:02:51.087
Was this your doing, Arshes?

00:02:52.046 --> 00:02:55.091
You shall die by my hand, Dark Schneider.

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:42.407
A great earthquake,
lightning and rain, and a big explosion.

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:45.743
It's exactly like
when the ninja fortress collapsed!

00:04:45.827 --> 00:04:47.578
The rubble is filling up the moat.

00:04:47.662 --> 00:04:49.122
The enemy is coming!

00:04:49.664 --> 00:04:51.291
-Get ready!
-Sir!

00:04:53.584 --> 00:04:55.295
Not the castle.

00:04:55.378 --> 00:04:57.463
It can't be. It can't.

00:04:57.547 --> 00:04:59.924
How… how could this happen?

00:05:01.509 --> 00:05:03.720
<i>The attack was so sudden, I only had time</i>

00:05:03.803 --> 00:05:06.514
<i>to put up a small anti-magic barrier.</i>

00:05:06.597 --> 00:05:10.727
I can't believe that she
actually knew how to use Megadeath.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.896
I can understand why they call her
the Empress of Thunder.

00:05:15.356 --> 00:05:17.150
However, I have to ask.

00:05:17.233 --> 00:05:20.236
Don't you think
you've gone too far this time?

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.572
Well? Answer me!

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:24.490
Stop it, Dark Schneider!

00:05:24.574 --> 00:05:27.452
If you go, then you won't make it out.

00:05:29.746 --> 00:05:32.999
<i>Will he be able</i>
<i>to fight her without holding back?</i>

00:05:33.499 --> 00:05:35.626
<i>I mean, he raised her.</i>

00:05:36.753 --> 00:05:40.590
<i>Maybe Lucien</i>
<i>really won't come back ever again.</i>

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:42.884
<i>What if he</i>…

00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:46.012
<i>Oh, I can't take it.</i>

00:05:46.095 --> 00:05:47.847
I… I…

00:05:48.348 --> 00:05:49.640
-Lu--
-Hey, Yoko.

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.976
Could I borrow some money?

00:05:54.103 --> 00:05:54.937
Huh?

00:05:58.941 --> 00:05:59.817
Thank you.

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:07.116
I'll be sure to return it.

00:06:10.661 --> 00:06:13.164
Looks like I won't be able
to avoid this fight.

00:06:13.247 --> 00:06:15.500
She's made the first move.
I'll have to counter.

00:06:15.583 --> 00:06:16.709
It's a griffin!

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:20.213
I've got no choice now.
Go and hide, both of you!

00:06:20.296 --> 00:06:21.464
Dark Schneider!

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:22.507
Lucien!

00:06:25.676 --> 00:06:27.595
Hear me, Dark Schneider!

00:06:27.678 --> 00:06:29.263
I promised I would come!

00:06:29.347 --> 00:06:31.224
Your life is mine to take!

00:06:31.307 --> 00:06:33.226
That's enough, Arshes.

00:06:33.309 --> 00:06:35.061
Ungrateful, annoying brat!

00:06:35.144 --> 00:06:37.647
You need to be seriously punished!

00:06:39.315 --> 00:06:40.316
Master Gara?

00:06:41.275 --> 00:06:43.569
I guess the battle's
finally getting started.

00:06:44.779 --> 00:06:46.155
This is bad.

00:06:46.239 --> 00:06:49.659
I thought the Raijinken got snapped
in two, but it's been restored!

00:06:50.451 --> 00:06:52.870
<i>The odds aren't looking good,</i>
<i>Dark Schneider.</i>

00:06:56.499 --> 00:06:57.917
Wa Quo!

00:07:00.086 --> 00:07:02.463
That's a high-mobility flying spell!

00:07:02.547 --> 00:07:05.675
Raven! Here I come!

00:07:05.758 --> 00:07:07.260
He's… he's flying!

00:07:07.343 --> 00:07:09.220
A human flying?

00:07:10.138 --> 00:07:11.806
I won't let you!

00:07:12.682 --> 00:07:16.644
Phil, Joe, Elliot, and Allen,
bless me with the sacred emblem.

00:07:16.727 --> 00:07:18.229
Grant me it's powers now.

00:07:18.312 --> 00:07:21.149
The ancient rights passed down
from ages long ago.

00:07:22.108 --> 00:07:24.402
What? What spell is she using now?

00:07:24.485 --> 00:07:26.529
This spell comes from the High Ancients,

00:07:26.612 --> 00:07:29.198
and is one not even you
would be familiar with.

00:07:29.699 --> 00:07:33.494
Def Leppard's
Black Liquid Lightning Sphere!

00:07:35.746 --> 00:07:37.498
Wha… what is that?

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.544
That lightning absorbs
all magic energy nearby,

00:07:41.627 --> 00:07:45.089
creating a bottomless pit
connected to an alternate dimension.

00:07:45.673 --> 00:07:48.426
Now you won't be able
to use your magic to fight.

00:07:48.509 --> 00:07:51.053
My magic's being drained!

00:07:51.137 --> 00:07:52.263
I'll fall!

00:07:55.641 --> 00:07:57.185
-Lucien!
-Dark Schneider!

00:07:57.768 --> 00:07:58.936
<i>Nei!</i>

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:03.024
<i>Nei knows that if they use their magic</i>
<i>to fight, then they're both going to die.</i>

00:08:03.107 --> 00:08:05.693
<i>That's why she's trying</i>
<i>to shift the battle to a sword fight!</i>

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:10.698
<i>He's in trouble!</i>

00:08:10.781 --> 00:08:13.576
<i>Nei's going to attack him</i>
<i>from above with the Raijinken!</i>

00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:15.286
<i>She's got the upper hand!</i>

00:08:16.078 --> 00:08:18.247
Now that your magic has been sealed away,

00:08:18.331 --> 00:08:20.583
you won't be able
to fight against the Raijinken!

00:08:21.792 --> 00:08:23.419
Guns N' Roses!

00:08:28.674 --> 00:08:30.510
What are you doing now?

00:08:30.593 --> 00:08:33.679
I told you!
Your magic is of no use to you!

00:08:33.763 --> 00:08:34.847
Now, die!

00:08:34.931 --> 00:08:37.099
Dragon Blast Demon Slash!

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:40.978
Dark Schneider!

00:08:44.482 --> 00:08:47.276
I'm unarmed. Things aren't looking good.

00:08:47.777 --> 00:08:51.364
<i>Damn!</i>
<i>I wish I could do something to help him.</i>

00:08:52.532 --> 00:08:54.825
<i>If only Dark Schneider had a weapon!</i>

00:08:55.743 --> 00:08:57.036
You were warned!

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:00.623
What's that?

00:09:02.583 --> 00:09:04.835
Huh? No. It can't be.

00:09:07.588 --> 00:09:10.341
Hear me, bearer of the Raijinken.

00:09:10.424 --> 00:09:13.886
I am Efreet,
the sole guardian of the Fire Sword,

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:18.140
and I will not allow you to lay hands
on my master without consequences!

00:09:18.724 --> 00:09:20.101
This is unexpected.

00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:22.228
Wait. Aren't you…?

00:09:22.311 --> 00:09:25.606
Did you forget
that you are the owner of the Fire Sword?

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:26.857
You are it's master.

00:09:26.941 --> 00:09:30.611
In turn, it shall devote itself
to you and all that you ask of it.

00:09:31.112 --> 00:09:35.491
After all, a sword's duty
is to protect and obey it's master.

00:09:35.575 --> 00:09:39.120
If the legendary sword,
Raijinken, is your enemy,

00:09:39.203 --> 00:09:43.416
then I, Efreet, shall transform
into the Fire Sword to fight for you!

00:09:46.085 --> 00:09:49.213
Look!
Efreet transformed into a sword!

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:54.093
It's…

00:09:54.176 --> 00:09:55.720
The Fire Sword!

00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:59.515
Dammit! This complicates things.

00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:02.935
You need to be taught when to shut up.

00:10:03.019 --> 00:10:05.479
For a demon, you're damned overbearing.

00:10:12.028 --> 00:10:13.154
Arshes!

00:10:13.237 --> 00:10:14.614
I won't miss this time.

00:10:16.198 --> 00:10:17.950
Dragon Blast Demon Slash!

00:10:18.034 --> 00:10:19.410
[Dark Schneider yelling

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.047
Robha!

00:10:34.091 --> 00:10:35.635
He did it!

00:10:36.218 --> 00:10:37.553
Amazing!

00:10:37.637 --> 00:10:40.556
He sliced the griffin in half
and sent it up in flames!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.558
What incredible power.

00:10:44.727 --> 00:10:46.771
Damn you to hell, Dark Schneider!

00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:55.905
She destroyed
the platform he stood on!

00:10:55.988 --> 00:10:58.908
The Raijinken is so destructive!

00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:12.046
I never imagined that you'd actually
be able to get a hold of the Fire Sword.

00:11:12.546 --> 00:11:14.340
I'm impressed, Dark Schneider.

00:11:14.423 --> 00:11:17.760
Not just anyone could tame Efreet,
guardian of that sword.

00:11:18.928 --> 00:11:23.891
However, within the Raijinken
resides Nue, the legendary Thunder Beast.

00:11:23.974 --> 00:11:27.812
Watch as I show you how Efreet doesn't
stand a chance against him one-on-one.

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.775
Are you done bragging yet?
Come on and fight me.

00:11:33.609 --> 00:11:34.985
Dark Schneider.

00:11:35.069 --> 00:11:36.529
<i>Lucien.</i>

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:40.116
<i>I can't believe</i>
<i>that Nue, the Thunder Beast,</i>

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:41.867
<i>is the guardian of the Raijinken!</i>

00:11:41.951 --> 00:11:43.285
Look!

00:11:43.369 --> 00:11:46.831
There's fire and lightning pouring
from the two swords.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.458
I can't believe it.

00:11:49.542 --> 00:11:51.711
The Fire Sword and the Thunder Sword.

00:11:51.794 --> 00:11:54.922
The two legendary magic swords
are facing off in battle!

00:11:55.423 --> 00:11:59.385
Master Gara! The Fire Sword
is just as powerful as the Raijinken.

00:11:59.468 --> 00:12:01.345
Maybe even more than we know.

00:12:01.846 --> 00:12:03.431
Now that the griffin is gone,

00:12:03.514 --> 00:12:06.934
it's finally an even match
between Dark Schneider and Nei!

00:12:07.643 --> 00:12:09.937
-I'm not sure that's the case.
-Huh?

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:12.690
Just because the two of them
are on equal footing,

00:12:12.773 --> 00:12:14.150
doesn't mean they're equal.

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:18.696
Now that their magic has been sealed away,
Dark Schneider is at a disadvantage.

00:12:18.779 --> 00:12:20.281
But… but why?

00:12:20.364 --> 00:12:22.992
Is the Fire Sword weaker
than the Raijinken?

00:12:23.075 --> 00:12:23.909
No.

00:12:23.993 --> 00:12:28.372
It's possible the Fire Sword possesses
even more strength than the Raijinken.

00:12:28.456 --> 00:12:29.457
Then, why?

00:12:30.166 --> 00:12:32.084
Dark Schneider's got
an incredible body

00:12:32.168 --> 00:12:34.420
and tremendous physical strength.

00:12:34.503 --> 00:12:37.339
But in the end, he's still a wizard.

00:12:37.423 --> 00:12:41.886
But Arshes Nei is a swordsman trained
in the Hariken Style of Swordsmanship.

00:12:41.969 --> 00:12:44.513
I'm not sure Dark Schneider can win.

00:12:45.347 --> 00:12:46.182
Hmm.

00:12:46.682 --> 00:12:49.059
<i>I hope he knows that too.</i>

00:12:49.143 --> 00:12:51.145
<i>Both of their swords are so powerful,</i>

00:12:51.228 --> 00:12:53.439
<i>neither one of them</i>
<i>will get a second chance.</i>

00:12:55.566 --> 00:12:57.985
<i>The battle's going</i>
<i>to be won by the first strike.</i>

00:12:59.028 --> 00:13:00.780
<i>This is momentous.</i>

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.407
<i>They're both going all-in.</i>

00:13:03.991 --> 00:13:05.618
<i>My stomach is in knots.</i>

00:13:06.577 --> 00:13:08.913
<i>I've got a bad feeling about this.</i>

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:17.087
<i>Lucien…</i>

00:13:48.369 --> 00:13:50.996
Secret Haouken Thunder Claw Strike!

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.541
<i>This attack</i>
<i>will kill him! This is bad!</i>

00:13:53.624 --> 00:13:54.500
Now, die!

00:13:54.583 --> 00:13:56.710
Watch out, Dark Schneider!

00:14:00.756 --> 00:14:02.258
I win, Dark Schneider!

00:14:02.341 --> 00:14:03.634
It's all over now.

00:14:04.426 --> 00:14:05.553
<i>Arsh.</i>

00:14:06.262 --> 00:14:07.888
Dark Schneider.

00:14:12.518 --> 00:14:16.105
You're cunning and reckless,
and both cruel and kind.

00:14:16.188 --> 00:14:17.606
Oh, great master,

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:20.860
you are the only person
in the world who has ever defeated me.

00:14:21.861 --> 00:14:23.904
You may have not realized it yet,

00:14:23.988 --> 00:14:27.658
but the world needs your power
more than ever, right now!

00:14:33.873 --> 00:14:36.667
-What?
-That's impossible! What are you doing?

00:14:37.251 --> 00:14:39.837
The honor
of the God of Fire is at stake.

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:43.132
I cannot let myself lose to the Raijinken!

00:14:47.469 --> 00:14:48.762
Goodbye!

00:14:49.263 --> 00:14:50.639
No! Stop, you fool!

00:14:51.724 --> 00:14:53.809
Victory is yours!

00:14:58.022 --> 00:14:59.148
But how could…?

00:14:59.732 --> 00:15:03.193
Efreet threw the Raijinken
into the ball of lightning.

00:15:07.156 --> 00:15:09.533
You stupid demon!

00:15:09.617 --> 00:15:12.244
No! Who told you
to kill yourself like that?

00:15:12.328 --> 00:15:15.539
This is ridiculous!

00:15:15.623 --> 00:15:18.083
Have you forgotten
that we're still fighting?

00:15:18.167 --> 00:15:20.044
-Here she comes!
-Lucien, no!

00:15:20.127 --> 00:15:22.755
The old you
would never have made such a mistake.

00:15:26.425 --> 00:15:28.719
<i>I win, Dark Schneider.</i>

00:15:29.929 --> 00:15:31.555
<i>That's the end of you.</i>

00:15:33.557 --> 00:15:35.643
-Dark…
-Dark Schneider!

00:15:37.436 --> 00:15:40.773
<i>He'll be okay.</i>
<i>He's immortal, after all.</i>

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.900
<i>Right, Lucien?</i>

00:15:45.402 --> 00:15:47.780
<i>Victory is yours!</i>

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:50.699
Efreet.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.958
<i>Wait. What's this light?</i>

00:16:06.298 --> 00:16:07.216
Nei.

00:16:08.926 --> 00:16:10.719
I… I can't believe it!

00:16:10.803 --> 00:16:13.681
Nei's knife-hand
through his skull should have killed him.

00:16:13.764 --> 00:16:15.516
Uh, is he immortal?

00:16:16.433 --> 00:16:17.393
I get it.

00:16:17.977 --> 00:16:20.020
<i>That ball of lightning that was absorbing</i>

00:16:20.104 --> 00:16:22.648
<i>all of Dark Schneider's</i>
<i>magic energy disappeared.</i>

00:16:22.731 --> 00:16:24.900
The defensive field
that protects Dark Schneider

00:16:24.984 --> 00:16:26.819
must have somehow recovered!

00:16:26.902 --> 00:16:29.947
Well, maybe now Dark Schneider
will be able to fight fair and square

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:31.699
with the Empress of Thunder!

00:16:31.782 --> 00:16:32.658
Hmm.

00:16:33.826 --> 00:16:36.829
<i>Now that they're fighting with magic,</i>
<i>it's an even match.</i>

00:16:37.329 --> 00:16:42.126
<i>However, the fight's going to end with</i>
<i>the complete obliteration of one of them.</i>

00:16:43.168 --> 00:16:44.545
<i>Or maybe even both of them.</i>

00:16:45.421 --> 00:16:46.630
<i>When swinging their swords,</i>

00:16:46.714 --> 00:16:49.633
<i>either one of them</i>
<i>can stop their blades in mid-swing.</i>

00:16:49.717 --> 00:16:51.635
<i>But if they fight with magic,</i>

00:16:51.719 --> 00:16:54.722
<i>once they cast a spell,</i>
<i>they can never pull it back.</i>

00:16:54.805 --> 00:16:56.473
Nei.

00:16:56.557 --> 00:16:58.767
Impossible.

00:16:59.518 --> 00:17:02.896
Nei! I'll never forgive you!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.440
I never will!

00:17:04.523 --> 00:17:07.735
You are my enemy
and not my family anymore!

00:17:07.818 --> 00:17:09.820
I'm gonna kill you!

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.784
What do you mean by "family"? What a joke!

00:17:15.868 --> 00:17:17.953
I never once
thought of you as a father figure.

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:19.747
Our time together was insignificant.

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:21.749
Oh, is that how it is?

00:17:22.374 --> 00:17:24.168
Wa Quo!

00:17:26.628 --> 00:17:28.881
-They started at the same time!
-Look!

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:30.674
Raven!

00:17:36.263 --> 00:17:39.767
O Demon Prince Tanimoore,
heed thy pact.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:40.934
Riot!

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:53.614
<i>They're an even match!</i>
<i>Their thunder attacks are equal in power!</i>

00:17:58.368 --> 00:18:00.788
Impressive, Dark Schneider!

00:18:00.871 --> 00:18:02.790
You're the first person in 15 years

00:18:02.873 --> 00:18:06.919
whose thunder attack is as powerful
as I, the Empress of Thunder's!

00:18:07.002 --> 00:18:09.129
We're an even match now, huh?

00:18:09.213 --> 00:18:10.422
You've gotten better.

00:18:11.006 --> 00:18:12.508
This is intense.

00:18:12.591 --> 00:18:15.135
Now both of them have
to be extremely careful.

00:18:15.636 --> 00:18:18.847
They now know that their thunder attacks
are equal in strength.

00:18:18.931 --> 00:18:20.432
In the upcoming attack,

00:18:20.516 --> 00:18:23.602
if one of them varies,
even slightly in speed or power,

00:18:23.685 --> 00:18:25.395
they could be obliterated.

00:18:27.815 --> 00:18:31.026
Brain, brain, dead.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:33.987
What's this?
Dark Schneider started casting first?

00:18:34.655 --> 00:18:36.865
Obey our covenant of blood.

00:18:36.949 --> 00:18:39.326
Come forth from the land of Abbadon.

00:18:39.409 --> 00:18:41.954
That spell, it's…

00:18:42.037 --> 00:18:43.163
Exodus!

00:18:43.705 --> 00:18:46.708
It's that fire spell
he used to subjugate Efreet!

00:18:47.626 --> 00:18:49.294
<i>Dark Schneider.</i>

00:18:49.878 --> 00:18:52.339
<i>Are you really going to kill Nei?</i>

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.133
Huh.

00:18:54.216 --> 00:18:56.343
Think your special explosion flame attack

00:18:56.426 --> 00:18:59.054
is going to beat me,
the Empress of Thunder?

00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:01.098
You underestimate, Dark Schneider.

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:03.517
Well, I'll show you.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.269
Brain, brain, dead!

00:19:05.352 --> 00:19:06.520
What?

00:19:07.104 --> 00:19:11.275
Obey our covenant of blood.
Come forth from the land of Abbadon!

00:19:11.358 --> 00:19:14.653
<i>Ugh. That's impossible!</i>
<i>Nei knows Exodus, too?</i>

00:19:14.736 --> 00:19:16.238
Oh, flames of Gehenna…

00:19:16.321 --> 00:19:18.490
-<i>No!</i>
-Be a fiery blast.

00:19:18.574 --> 00:19:20.367
<i>If that spell clashes with itself…</i>

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.411
And burn through all!

00:19:22.494 --> 00:19:25.330
Stop it! You're gonna both end up dead!

00:19:25.414 --> 00:19:27.082
Exodus!

00:19:27.166 --> 00:19:28.542
Dark Schneider!

00:19:29.209 --> 00:19:31.420
-<i>Darsh.</i>
-<i>Lucien!</i>

00:19:33.505 --> 00:19:34.882
<i>Darsh.</i>

00:19:34.965 --> 00:19:36.091
Darsh.

00:19:36.175 --> 00:19:37.759
Darsh. Darsh.

00:19:37.843 --> 00:19:40.262
Darsh. I love you.

00:19:41.263 --> 00:19:42.514
Arsh.

00:19:43.724 --> 00:19:45.559
Just die!

00:20:11.335 --> 00:20:12.377
<i>Lucien.</i>

00:20:22.512 --> 00:20:23.805
<i>That idiot.</i>

00:20:24.306 --> 00:20:27.142
<i>He gave in to his feelings</i>
<i>at the critical moment.</i>

00:20:27.226 --> 00:20:29.353
<i>That one split-second of hesitation</i>

00:20:29.436 --> 00:20:32.773
<i>made him lose focus on controlling</i>
<i>the enormous ball of heat generated</i>

00:20:32.856 --> 00:20:33.982
<i>by that spell.</i>

00:20:34.066 --> 00:20:38.320
<i>It caused an infinitesimal drop in</i>
<i>the speed and power of his Exodus spell.</i>

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.155
Dark Schneider!

00:20:40.239 --> 00:20:43.075
You had better not go dying
on me right now!

00:20:43.659 --> 00:20:45.577
Master Gara's coming to save you--

00:20:45.661 --> 00:20:48.580
-Stop, Master Gara!
-Your wounds are too severe!

00:20:48.664 --> 00:20:50.791
Master Gara.

00:20:51.625 --> 00:20:53.418
Dark Schneider!

00:20:55.337 --> 00:20:57.256
You're a fool.

00:20:57.339 --> 00:21:01.551
How could you let your heart waver
in the midst of a life-or-death battle?

00:21:02.052 --> 00:21:03.887
And they call you a legend?

00:21:03.971 --> 00:21:06.431
How you've changed, Dark Schneider.

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.351
Dark Schneider.

00:21:09.434 --> 00:21:10.978
Princess Sheila.

00:21:12.688 --> 00:21:14.189
Could that be it?

00:21:14.273 --> 00:21:17.109
Meta-llicana is forever lost.

00:21:17.192 --> 00:21:18.860
<i>He'll be okay.</i>

00:21:18.944 --> 00:21:20.821
<i>I'm sure he'll be okay.</i>

00:21:20.904 --> 00:21:26.535
<i>I know because…</i>
<i>because I let him borrow 500 yen!</i>

00:21:26.618 --> 00:21:30.247
Now, Lucien.
Make sure to pay this back, okay?

00:21:30.998 --> 00:21:34.751
<i>I taught him always to return money</i>
<i>whenever you borrow it.</i>

00:21:36.003 --> 00:21:38.839
<i>I raise him well since he was a child.</i>

00:21:38.922 --> 00:21:42.134
<i>Please, come back to us, Lucien.</i>

00:23:25.070 --> 00:23:25.946
Nei?

00:23:26.029 --> 00:23:27.406
Wha… what's that?

00:23:33.787 --> 00:23:36.164
Dark Schneider!

00:23:36.706 --> 00:23:39.543
The ultimate handsome hero is back

00:23:39.626 --> 00:23:43.880
with an immortal, made-of-steel,
big volcano, big eruption storm,

00:23:43.964 --> 00:23:45.132
coming just for you.

00:23:45.215 --> 00:23:48.552
Oh, yeah. We're gonna do it!
